    {
      "ref": "01KGVK8R",
      "text": "Item list --module flag and tree view: kspec item list --module cli to scope output to a specific module. kspec item tree @module for hierarchical view (features -> requirements). Currently 50+ items display flat, making it hard to find the right parent for new specs. Friction: during automation triage had to grep YAML files to find parent specs.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-07T08:25:05.490Z",
