    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ27VR",
      "text": "Spec and test kspec behavior without git: ensure kspec works in projects without git initialized, and handles git being introduced into an existing project where kspec is already in use. Cover shadow branch initialization, worktree setup on first git init, migration of .kspec/ state when git appears, and graceful degradation of git-dependent features (auto-commit, sync, shadow status).",
      "created_at": "2026-02-22T08:36:08.131Z",
