      "triage_action": "defer"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ3318",
      "text": "Session checkpoint hook noise: fires repeatedly for intentionally uncommitted files (e.g. generated reports). No way to suppress for specific paths. Could support .kspec/checkpoint-ignore listing paths to exclude from dirty-tree check, or respect gitignore-like patterns. Fired 6+ times in one session for a triage report artifact.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:31:00.545Z",
