    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ4FFA",
      "text": "Web UI list pages hardcode limit: 1000 with no pagination — triage page confirmed, likely affects inbox/tasks pages too. Silent truncation for large datasets. Need pagination or virtual scrolling pattern across all list views.",
