      "triage_action": "promote"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ63QD",
      "text": "Agents should check plan_ref when starting tasks. If a task has plan_ref, run kspec plan get @plan-ref to read implementation notes, algorithm details, and context. Update task-work skill and task-work-loop workflow to include this step. Plans are the right place for rich implementation context instead of cramming it into task notes.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:40:49.913Z",
