      "triage_action": "promote"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ63RW",
      "text": "Plan import --update replaces all ACs instead of merging. When extending an existing spec with a new AC via plan import, --update overwrites acceptance_criteria entirely. Need AC-merge strategy: append new AC IDs, preserve existing ones. Encountered during spec-plan for session-log-show ac-10.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:41:37.216Z",
