    {
      "ref": "01KJ67G4",
      "text": "Ralph event handler iteration attribution should use session-scoped mapping instead of shared mutable currentIteration. Codex review on PR #484 identified that late updates from a previous ACP session can still be tagged with wrong iteration. Use session_id→iteration map or session-scoped listener. See PR #484 review comment.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-23T21:46:45.158Z",
