      "triage_action": "promote"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ6KTD",
      "text": "CLI args should accept both kebab-case and underscore variants (e.g. depends-on and depends_on). Currently batch commands reject underscore variants even though the error message suggests the kebab form. Normalizing both forms would reduce friction, especially for agents generating JSON batch payloads where underscore is the natural convention.",
