      "triage_action": "promote"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ6ZXC",
      "text": "kspec batch --commands '' hangs instead of erroring — empty/missing args should fail fast with a clear error, not block on stdin. Discovered when ralph loop got stuck calling batch with empty string arg.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-24T04:53:24.637Z",
      "tags": [],
      "added_by": "@claude",
      "triaged": true,
      "triage_action": "promote"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ76Y8",
      "text": "Session-scoped workflow runs: workflow runs could carry a session_id, filtering workflow show/list to current session by default. Session end could auto-close orphaned runs. Reduces noise when multiple sessions active (ralph + interactive). Natural fit since workflows are already ephemeral.",
