    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ778T",
      "text": "Ralph loop logs 'Unexpected case' for rate_limit_event messages from Claude API. These are informational SSE events (status: allowed) that the event handler doesn't recognize. Should either handle gracefully (ignore/log at debug level) or add to known event types. Currently noisy in ralph output.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-24T07:01:59.509Z",
