    },
    {
      "ref": "01KJ7CNA",
      "text": "Shadow branch index inconsistency: observation @01KJ73ME appeared in search results but failed on kspec item get. Possible write conflict or index corruption during ralph loop session. Investigate shadow branch integrity.",
