      "text": "Ralph CLI renderer: parallel tool calls produce confusing output. tool_result events render sequentially with no association to their tool_start, so when multiple tools run in parallel, results appear under the wrong header. Fix: include tool summary (e.g. filename) in the completed/failed status line so each result is self-identifying regardless of interleaving.",
