      "text": "Tests fail when run inside ralph loop due to environment contamination: (1) ralph.test.ts KSPEC_RALPH_SESSION assertion expects null but env var is inherited from ralph process, (2) session-create.test.ts active session warning in stderr breaks JSON parsing, (3) session-budget-integration.test.ts references nonexistent task set-automation command. Tests should isolate from parent process env vars (KSPEC_RALPH_SESSION, KSPEC_SESSION_ID) to be reliable in all contexts.",
